  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Civila samh&#xe4;llet IDF II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HR Civil Society IDF II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Oberoende utvecklingsfonden &#xe4;r en givargemensam mekanism skapad f&#xf6;r   att ge st&#xf6;d och service till ugandiska organisationer i               civilsamh&#xe4;llet. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka deras kapacitet att effektivt     bidra till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttssituation, demokratisk             samh&#xe4;llsstyrning och fattigdomsminskning. St&#xf6;d och service ges i form av bidrag till organisationerna. Sidas st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r 10,5 MSEK 2010-12.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Independent Development Fund is a joint donor funding mechanism   established to offer support services to Ugandan civil society        organizations to strengthen their capacities to effectively           contribute to the country&apos;s human rights, good governance and poverty reduction efforts. These support services are provided through grants and grant management support. Sida support is 10,5 MSEK 2010-12.</narrative>
  </description>
